lan-pricing-block .price-cycle {font-size: 13px;color: var(--c-brown-muted);margin-top: 4px}\n.plan-features-list {list-style: none;display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);gap: 12px 24px}\n.plan-features-list li {font-size: 13.5px;color: var(--c-brown-main);position: relative;padding-left: 14px}\n.plan-features-list li::before {content: \"\";position: absolute;left: 0;top: 9px;width: 5px;height: 5px;border-radius: 50%;background-color: var(--c-mint-accent)}\n.plan-action-block {text-align: right}\n.btn-select {display: inline-block;padding: 10px 22px;background-color: var(--c-brown-deep);color: #ffffff;font-size: 13px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;transition: background-color 0.15s ease}\n.btn-select:hover {background-color: var(--c-mint-primary)}\n.plan-item.is-featured .btn-select {background-color: var(--c-mint-primary)}\n.plan-item.is-featured .btn-select:hover {background-color: var(--c-brown-deep)}\n\n/* 客户端支持区域（中性技术指南） */\n.clients-layout {display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);gap: 32px}\n.client-segment {background-color: var(--c-surface);padding: 36px 32px}\n.client-segment h3 {font-family: var(--font-serif);font-size: 18px;font-weight: 500;color: var(--c-brown-deep);margin-bottom: 12px}\n.client-segment p {font-size: 13px;color: var(--c-brown-muted);line-height: 1.7;margin-bottom: 18px}\n.client-meta-label {font-size: 11px;text-transform: uppercase;letter-spacing: 0.12em;color: var(--c-brown-light);margin-bottom: 6px}\n.client-meta-val {font-size: 13px;color: var(--c-brown-main);font-family: monospace}\n\n/* 部署说明与步骤 */\n.steps-wrapper {margin-top: 16px;display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);gap: 24px}\n.step-card {background-color: var(--c-surface);padding: 28px 24px}\n.step-num {font-family: var(--font-serif);font-size: 20px;color: var(--c-mint-primary);margin-bottom: 12px;display: block}\n.step-card h4 {font-size: 15px;font-weight: 600;color: var(--c-brown-deep);margin-bottom: 8px}\n.step-card p {font-size: 13px;color: var(--c-brown-muted);line-height: 1.6}\n\n/* FAQ：details 折叠展示 */\n.faq-container {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 16px}\n.faq-item {background-color: var(--c-surface);padding: 0;transition: background-color 0.15s ease}\n.faq-item[open] {background-color: var(--c-surface-soft)}\n.faq-item summary {padding: 24px 28px;font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: var(--c-brown-deep);cursor: pointer;list-style: none;position: relative}\n.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {display: none}\n.faq-item summary::after {content: \"+\";position: absolute;right: 28px;top: 50%;transform: translateY(-50%);font-size: 18px;color: var(--c-mint-primary);font-weight: 400}\n.faq-item[open] summary::after {content: \"—\"}\n.faq-content {padding: 0 28px 24px;font-size: 14px;color: var(--c-brown-muted);line-height: 1.75}\n\n/* 页脚 */\n.site-footer {margin-top: 96px;padding: 48px 0 64px;border-top: 1px solid rgba(59, 46, 39, 0.1);font-size: 12px;color: var(--c-brown-light);line-height: 1.8}\n.footer-inner {display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: flex-start;flex-wrap: wrap;gap: 24px}\n.footer-text {max-width: 600px}\n\n/* 响应式调整 */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {.hero-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 32px;padding: 40px 0;}\n  .hero-lead-col h1 {\n    font-size: 34px;}\n  .plan-item {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 24px;padding: 32px 24px;}\n  .plan-action-block {\n    text-align: left;}\n  .clients-layout {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;}\n  .steps-wrapper {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;}}\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .steps-wrapper {grid-template-columns: 1fr}\n  .plan-features-list {grid-template-columns: 1fr}\n}\n</style><header class=\"site-nav\">\n  <div class=\"site-nav-inner\">\n    <span class=\"brand-mark\">LUKTA / 狼塔</span>\n    <nav class=\"nav-links\">\n      <a href=\"#overview\">系统综述</a>\n      <a href=\"#plans\">订阅阶梯</a>\n      <a href=\"#setup\">客户端配置</a>\n      <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  \n  <section id=\"overview\" class=\"hero-grid\">\n    <div class=\"hero-lead-col\">\n      <div class=\"tagline-meta\">网络中继与协议接口</div>\n      <h1>狼塔 数据传输网络服务规约</h1>\n      <p>狼塔致力于构建具备确定性吞吐能力与清晰结构的网络中继路由。本文档收录当前支持的协议接口、订阅配置等级以及跨操作系统的标准终端集成方法，供接入方进行评估与部署。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-quote-col\">\n      <blockquote>\n        “网络的价值在于传输过程中的透明与克制，而非冗余包装。任何规则都应具备可读性与确定边界。”\n      </blockquote>\n      — 狼塔系统架构备忘录 / 卷七\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-spec-col\">\n      <div class=\"spec-entry\">\n        <div class=\"spec-entry-title\">基准协议栈</div>\n        <div class=\"spec-entry-value\">支持通用标准中继、TLS 混淆层及兼容格式订阅串。</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"spec-entry\">\n        <div class=\"spec-entry-title\">调度拓扑</div>\n        <div class=\"spec-entry-value\">多区域边缘转发节点，采用双向心跳检测与负载均衡分流。</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"spec-entry\">\n        <div class=\"spec-entry-title\">接入标准</div>\n        <div class=\"spec-entry-value\">兼容主流第三方通用内核，不绑定闭源私有执行程序。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"plans\">\n    <header class=\"section-header\">\n      <div class=\"section-meta\">Plans &amp; Quota</div>\n      <h2>狼塔 订阅规格与配额方案</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">方案依传输容量与并行终端数设计，各规格均遵循一致的节点同步周期与传输协议规范，按月或按年结算。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"plans-stack\">\n      \n      <article class=\"plan-item\">\n        <div class=\"plan-head-wrap\">\n          <span class=\"plan-tag\">ENTRY / 个人入门</span>\n          <h3>基础版</h3>\n          <div class=\"plan-pricing-block\">\n            <div class=\"price-current\">¥15<span> / 月</span></div>\n            <div class=\"price-cycle\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features-list\">\n          <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n          <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-action-block\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-select\">选配此方案</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      \n      <article class=\"plan-item is-featured\">\n        <div class=\"plan-head-wrap\">\n          <span class=\"plan-tag\">RECOMMENDED / 推荐规格</span>\n          <h3>旗舰版</h3>\n          <div class=\"plan-pricing-block\">\n            <div class=\"price-current\">¥35<span> / 月</span></div>\n            <div class=\"price-cycle\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features-list\">\n          <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n          <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n          <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-action-block\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-select\">选配此方案</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      \n      <article class=\"plan-item\">\n        <div class=\"plan-head-wrap\">\n          <span class=\"plan-tag\">ORGANIZATION / 多端协作</span>\n          <h3>团队版</h3>\n          <div class=\"plan-pricing-block\">\n            <div class=\"price-current\">¥85<span> / 月</span></div>\n            <div class=\"price-cycle\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features-list\">\n          <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n          <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n          <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-action-block\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-select\">选配此方案</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"setup\">\n    <header class=\"section-header\">\n      <div class=\"section-meta\">Workflow</div>\n      <h2>通用配置作业流程</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">狼塔节点基于通用协议标准分发。完成订阅后，请依据下述步骤在受支持的客户端中加载配置文件。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"steps-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"step-card\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">01</span>\n        <h4>生成订阅令牌</h4>\n        <p>在用户控制台获取专属订阅 URL 或 BASE64 配置字符串，请妥善保存该凭据。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-card\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">02</span>\n        <h4>配置核心工具</h4>\n        <p>选用匹配所处操作系统的开源或第三方图形化管理工具，建立新配置集。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-card\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">03</span>\n        <h4>同步端点清单</h4>\n        <p>通过远程拉取功能将狼塔分发配置写入本地缓存，并设定定时更新周期。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-card\">\n        <span class=\"step-num\">04</span>\n        <h4>分流与规则检验</h4>\n        <p>依实际工作环境设定直连与中继的路由白名单，校验 DNS 与连通性。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section>\n    <header class=\"section-header\">\n      <div class=\"section-meta\">Clients &amp; Protocols</div>\n      <h2>第三方客户端兼容说明</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">狼塔不强制捆绑专有客户端，接入方可使用任意支持标准协议的开源或主流终端接入。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"clients-layout\">\n      <div class=\"client-segment\">\n        <h3>macOS / iOS 环境</h3>\n        <p>可选用支持 Clash 或 Surge 规范的核心配置工具。导入托管订阅后，系统将自动映射策略组并完成本地 TUN 接口的接管。</p>\n        <div class=\"client-meta-label\">推荐配置方式</div>\n        <div class=\"client-meta-val\">HTTP(S) Remote Subscription</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"client-segment\">\n        <h3>Windows 环境</h3>\n        <p>兼容主流基于 Clash Core、sing-box 或 v2rayN 的 GUI 外壳。导入 URI 链接后，建议勾选系统代理同步与绕过局域网规则。</p>\n        <div class=\"client-meta-label\">运行环境需求</div>\n        <div class=\"client-meta-val\">.NET Desktop / TAP-Windows</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"client-segment\">\n        <h3>Android &amp; Linux 环境</h3>\n        <p>移动端可选用 Clash Meta for Android 等应用；Linux 平台支持以 systemd 守护进程运行 core 二进制程序，实现无界面纯静默路由转发。</p>\n        <div class=\"client-meta-label\">守护形式</div>\n        <div class=\"client-meta-val\">Service Unit / Daemon CLI</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"faq\">\n    <header class=\"section-header\">\n      <div class=\"section-meta\">Knowledge Base</div>\n      <h2>常见问题处理与规约说明</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">整理关于账户生命周期、流量结算重置及终端并发的常见技术考量。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-container\">\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>狼塔各方案中的“同时在线设备”是如何判定的？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          系统根据活跃连接池的终端标识与并行心跳数进行统计。当处于同一局域网的设备通过路由器单一出口接入时，服务端仅计为一个活跃客户端；若跨网络多端发起握手，则各端占用一个在线名额。超出限制时，新发起的连接请求将被系统挂起或排队。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>订阅流量的重置周期与结转规则是怎样的？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          流量配额均以订阅开通之日起算的一个自然周期（通常为 30 天）为单位重置，当期未消耗的流量不结转至下一周期。配额耗尽后，节点中继端口将暂停服务，直至新账期开始或用户在面板中执行配额增购操作。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>节点列表出现部分超时或不可用时应如何排查？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          首先请在终端执行一次配置更新，确保订阅地址拉取的是最新的可用节点清单。其次，检查本地系统时间与网络授时服务器是否存在偏差（若偏差超过 90 秒，TLS 握手将失败）。若仍异常，可在配置中暂时切换路由模式至直连以排除本地 DNS 劫持问题。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>旗舰版提供的“IPLC 专线”与普通节点有何技术差异？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          专线节点在过境传输环节采用预先划分的物理或局域私有链路，不经过公网公用网关交换节点，因此抖动率更低且避开了高峰时段的公网拥塞。普通线路则依赖公网动态路由解析与转发。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"site-footer\">\n  <div class=\"site-nav-inner footer-inner\">\n    <div class=\"footer-text\">\n      <p>狼塔（LUKTA）网络服务规范。本文档仅提供网络技术接口参考及接入指引，所有服务参数以用户控制台签署生效的实际配置清单为准。</p>\n      <p>© 狼塔. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <span>系统状态：正常运行</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>",
